      "source": [
        "# Coroutine\n",
        "\n",
        "A coroutine is an awaitable computation that can suspend and resume. Calling a coroutine function creates a coroutine object; it must be awaited or scheduled to run.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-coroutine)"
      ]
    }
